From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Dugs <dugahol@protonmail.com>
Date: Fri, 27 Nov 2026 00:30:00 +1030
Subject: [PATCH] kboot: Copy the compass calibration

The A11's AOP serves a compass, and iOS's AppleSPU sends its factory
calibration from the iop-aop-nub/compass node: compass-calibration
(0x0b), compass-orientation (0x18) and compass-sens-calibration (0x1d).
Copy them like the motion sensors' calibration; the values never leave
the device.

Assisted-by: LLM
Signed-off-by: Dugs <dugahol@protonmail.com>
Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
--- a/src/kboot.c
+++ b/src/kboot.c
@@ -1037,6 +1037,10 @@
     "pressure-offset-calibration",
     "pressure-accel-sensitivity",
     "pressure-heater-resistance",
+    /* compass: the A11 AOP's magnetometer */
+    "compass-calibration",
+    "compass-orientation",
+    "compass-sens-calibration",
 };
 
 static int dt_set_aop_sensors(int node)
